From a5493f4a3b968949dd14f2b5944386852b17c59b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 24 Aug 2026 14:17:56 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] perf(kv-pool): optimize Yuanrong backend operations

Use Yuanrong multi-buffer APIs with JSON-configured timeouts, avoid scheduler data-plane initialization, and skip redundant existence checks while preserving KV event semantics.

Signed-off-by: yangsonglin13 <yangsonglin566@gmail.com>
---
